'philippines-employment-provider-proposal-comparison':['normalize scope before comparing totals','One proposal bundles onboarding into one line. Another lists six activities but excludes account coordination.','a decision that explains residual work and cost'],
'philippines-remote-employee-manager-readiness':['confirm the manager has useful work and a decision rhythm ready','The equipment is ready, but the manager has not chosen a first assignment or reserved overlap time.','a workable first week with named help'],
'philippines-employment-onboarding-information-request':['collect only data required at each approved stage','A shared onboarding sheet asks for bank and identity details although most viewers coordinate equipment.','staged requests with narrower access'],
'philippines-payroll-input-cutoff-calendar':['turn one release date into owner-specific milestones','Managers think inputs are due Friday while payroll needs approved sources Wednesday for review.','a calendar that shows when work becomes late'],
'philippines-payroll-correction-request-workflow':['separate a reported concern from an approved correction','An employee reports a missing allowance before anyone checks the approved source and effective period.','a traceable account of what was reported and changed'],
'philippines-employee-record-change-request':['apply an authorized change without losing history','A manager changes a title in chat while the employment record and reporting hierarchy remain unchanged.','one accepted lineage across authorized systems'],
'philippines-leave-handoff-manager-provider':['separate the leave decision from downstream preparation','A manager writes fine with me, but the message lacks a leave category, partial-day detail, and timezone.','one approved event represented consistently'],
'philippines-benefits-enrollment-evidence-checklist':['prove an approved enrollment was accepted by the provider','A file arrives successfully, but one dependent row is rejected for an unsupported relationship code.','evidence that separates transport from enrollment'],
'philippines-offboarding-knowledge-transfer-plan':['move recurring obligations before access removal','A departing coordinator documents daily tasks but remains sole owner of a monthly report and automation.','accepted ownership before access removal'],
'philippines-employment-support-monthly-review':['use monthly evidence to improve service design','Average closure looks fast while reopened old cases receive new identifiers and disappear from aging.','a short action register tied to evidence'],
